1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,460
 The great Redeemer of all knows absolutely everything about this unnamed woman.

2
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:16,040
 And he comes to her to be a living witness of living water.

3
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:20,840
 He offers her grace and transformative help.

4
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:25,040
 He spoke to the woman with dignity, not shame.

5
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:32,200
 He earnestly listened to her questions and responded with teaching, not ridicule.

6
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:35,560
 He did not hold her hostage to her history.

7
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:39,760
 He trusted her with truth.

8
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:45,280
 Jesus Christ reminds us that to help people transform their lives, we must look not only

9
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,280
 to their past.

10
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:51,360
 We must look to their possible.

11
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:57,240
 She walked to the well that day as a pariah.

12
00:00:57,240 --> 00:01:02,080
 She walked away from the well with a purpose.

13
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:10,040
 That is precisely what quick to help and slow to judge looks like.

14
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:12,400
 Every day missionaries meet people at modern day.

